          There is no single best product, because a fresh puddle, a months-old drip and a decade-old garage floor stain need different chemistry. Here is which remover fits which stain.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="#terminator-hsd"
            class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#FF4500] hover:bg-[#E63E00] text-white font-black rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all no-underline"
