                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Speed</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Asphalt-safe</th>
                    <th class="px-4 py-4 font-bold text-gray-600 text-sm">Typical cost</th>
